[""],"Unlink":[""],"Not linked":[""],"Online":[""],"Maximum chats for %s":[""],"Enrollment code":[""],"No operators yet.":[""],"Add operator":[""],"Choose a user\u2026":[""],"Operator added.":[""],"Enrollment codes expire after 10 minutes and work once. The operator sends \u201c\/link CODE\u201d to the bot in a private chat.":[""],"Teams scope which unassigned conversations an operator sees, and can route to their own Telegram group for isolation.":[""],"Team":[""],"Telegram destination":[""],"Members":[""],"Default destination":[""],"Delete this team?":[""],"Team name":[""],"Assignment":[""],"Manual (claim)":[""],"Round robin":[""],"Least busy":[""],"Separate Telegram chat ID (optional)":[""],"Team saved.":[""],"Update team":[""],"Add team":[""],"Automatic assignment only picks operators who are currently online (explicit availability plus a recent inbox heartbeat or a Telegram \/online). Telegram does not report online status by itself.":[""],"The queue worker has not run in the last 10 minutes. WP-Cron only runs when the site gets traffic; set up a real cron job (below).":[""],"Messages have been waiting more than 5 minutes. Check the errors below and the worker schedule.":[""],"DISABLE_WP_CRON is set but no worker has run recently. Add the system cron job below.":[""],"Private attachments are reachable over HTTP. Your server ignores the protective rules (common on Nginx). Add this rule or define TELEVIXO_STORAGE_DIR outside the web root:":[""],"Some secrets can no longer be decrypted (were the WordPress salts changed?). Re-enter the bot token in Setup.":[""],"Delivery queue":[""],"Processed %1$d jobs and %2$d updates.":[""],"Run worker now":[""],"Waiting":[""],"Uncertain":[""],"Failed":[""],"Incoming updates pending":[""],"Worker last ran":[""],"Job status":[""],"Delivered":[""],"The request timed out after it may have reached Telegram. Telegram has no idempotent send, so retrying could post a duplicate. Check the Telegram chat first, then retry or discard.":[""],"Type":[""],"Conversation":[""],"Attempts":[""],"Error":[""],"Updated":[""],"Discard":[""],"Nothing here.":[""],"Background processing":[""],"Messages are processed right after each request when possible and every minute by WP-Cron. WP-Cron depends on site traffic, so on low-traffic sites add a real cron job:":[""],"Without WP-CLI, request wp-cron.php every minute instead (and set DISABLE_WP_CRON to true in wp-config.php):":[""],"Diagnostics":[""],"Redacted: contains no tokens, secrets or message content. Safe to share with support.":[""],"Dates use the site time zone (%s). Automated messages never count as responses; spam is excluded.":[""],"From":[""],"To":[""],"Unanswered":[""],"Median first human response":[""],"Median resolution time":[""],"Median queue wait":[""],"CSAT (%d ratings)":[""],"Conversations per day":[""],"Daily table":[""],"Operator":[""],"Assignments":[""],"Replies":[""],"Median first response":[""],"CSAT":[""],"No data.":[""],"No team":[""],"Automation conversion":[""],"Visitors shown a proactive message who started a conversation within 30 minutes. Counts only visitors who already had a chat session.":[""],"Rule":[""],"Shown":[""],"Rate":[""],"Entire site":[""],"Page\/post IDs":[""],"Content type":[""],"Template":[""],"Taxonomy term (taxonomy:ID)":[""],"Page kind":[""],"URL path":[""],"Query parameter":[""],"Logged in":[""],"User role":[""],"Viewport width (px)":[""],"Site language":[""],"New or returning visitor":[""],"UTM source":[""],"UTM medium":[""],"UTM campaign":[""],"Business hours":[""],"WooCommerce page":[""],"WooCommerce product IDs":[""],"Product category IDs":[""],"Cart value":[""],"Cart item count":[""],"Visible time on page (s)":[""],"Scroll depth (%)":[""],"Inactivity (s)":[""],"Exit intent (desktop only)":[""],"Rule shown before":[""],"Conversation state":[""],"Chat opened this session":[""],"is":[""],"is any of":[""],"is none of":[""],"equals":[""],"contains":[""],"matches (* wildcard)":[""],"does not match":[""],"exists":[""],"does not exist":[""],"at least":[""],"at most":[""],"is empty":[""],"within the last":[""],"not within the last":[""],"Show\/hide launcher":[""],"Show a teaser message":[""],"Open the chat":[""],"Show an automated message":[""],"Select department":[""],"Change greeting":[""],"yes":[""],"no":[""],"Parameter":[""],"Value":[""],"Hours":[""],"hours (rule ID, 0 = this rule)":[""],"Rule ID":[""],"Group logic":[""],"All of these (AND)":[""],"Any of these (OR)":[""],"NOT":[""],"Remove group":[""],"Condition":[""],"Remove condition":[""],"Add condition":[""],"Add group":[""],"Rule saved.":[""],"Targeting & proactive messages":[""],"Rules run in the visitor\u2019s browser (so they work with page caching). Higher priority wins each action slot; exclusions always win; one proactive message per page view; dismissing the chat stops further prompts for the session.":[""],"New rule":[""],"Export":[""],"Actions":[""],"Enabled":[""],"Delete this rule?":[""],"No rules yet. Example: on \/pricing*, after 15 visible seconds, if the chat was not opened and the rule was not shown in 24 hours, show a teaser once.":[""],"Import rules":[""],"Paste a rules export":[""],"Imported %d rules (disabled).":[""],"Edit rule #%d":[""],"Priority (higher wins)":[""],"When":[""],"Except when (exclusions)":[""],"Add exclusions":[""],"Then":[""],"Action":[""],"Text":[""],"Visibility":[""],"show":[""],"hide":[""],"Department key":[""],"Remove action":[""],"Add action":[""],"Frequency & stopping":[""],"Max per page view":[""],"Max per session":[""],"Max per visitor":[""],"Cooldown (hours)":[""],"Expires on":[""],"Stop after the visitor sends a message":[""],"Stop when the visitor starts typing":[""],"Stop after the visitor closes the chat or dismisses a prompt":[""],"Stop once a person has replied":[""],"Skip if the chat was already opened this session":[""],"Save rule":[""],"Why does a rule match?":[""],"Simulate a page view (JSON context). Keys: path, query, device, viewport_width, time_on_page, scroll_depth, logged_in, roles, post_type, woo_page, cart_value, utm, seen {ruleId: unixTime}, now\u2026":[""],"Context":[""],"Test this rule":[""],"Test all enabled rules":[""],"Effective actions:":[""],"none":[""],"matched":[""],"no match":[""],"Rule #%d":[""],"actual":[""],"Exit intent is detected only on desktop (mouse leaves the top of the window). There is no reliable exit intent on mobile, so it never fires there. Visitors are never fingerprinted; \"returning\" uses a first-party browser flag disclosed in the privacy policy text.":[""],"Connected to @%s.":[""],"Some checks failed. Fix them in Telegram and check again, or save anyway.":[""],"Webhook registered. Telegram will now deliver operator replies to this site.":[""],"1. Connect your bot":[""],"Create a bot with @BotFather in Telegram, then paste its token. Use a dedicated bot for this website: a bot can only send updates to one webhook.":[""],"Token set in wp-config.php":[""],"Not connected":[""],"Bot token":[""],"Stored encrypted. It is never shown again or sent to the browser.":[""],"Replace token":[""],"Test & save":[""],"2. Choose where chats appear":[""],"Add the bot to a Telegram group for your team (or use a private chat with one operator). Then send any message in that group so it appears below, or enter its chat ID.":[""],"Everyone in the chosen group can read the visitor messages relayed there. If teams must not see each other\u2019s chats, use a separate group per team (Operators & teams) or answer only in the WordPress inbox.":[""],"Chats the bot has seen recently":[""],"topics":[""],"Chat ID":[""],"Group IDs start with -100.":[""],"Routing mode for new conversations":[""],"Reply Mode \u2013 operators reply to the bot\u2019s message":[""],"Topics Mode \u2013 one forum topic per conversation":[""],"Existing conversations keep the mode they started with.":[""],"Reply Mode works with privacy mode on: the bot receives replies to its own messages. Operators must use Telegram\u2019s Reply on a visitor message; plain group messages are ignored.":[""],"Topics Mode needs a supergroup with Topics enabled and the bot as administrator with \u201cManage topics\u201d. Every message an enrolled operator writes inside a conversation topic is sent to the visitor, except lines starting with the note prefix.":[""],"Check & save":[""],"OK":[""],"Action needed":[""],"Save anyway":[""],"Current destination: %1$s (%2$s)":[""],"3. Receive replies (webhook)":[""],"Telegram sends operator replies to this address. HTTPS is required.":[""],"This site is not served over HTTPS, so Telegram cannot deliver webhooks.":[""],"Registered to this site":[""],"Registered to another host: %s":[""],"Not registered":[""],"%d updates waiting at Telegram":[""],"Last error":[""],"Last update received:":[""],"Register webhook":[""],"Remove webhook":[""],"Send test message":[""],"4. Link operators":[""],"Each operator links their Telegram account once, so their replies can be authorized individually. Operators must open a private chat with the bot and press Start before linking.":[""],"Link my Telegram account":[""],"Send this to @%1$s in a private chat within 10 minutes: %2$s":[""],"Manage other operators under Operators & teams. Anonymous group admins cannot reply to visitors because they cannot be identified.":[""],"Telegram setup":[""]}}}